    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这么近那么美 周末到河北</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk99KtCLy2MMjnUjU6upyllAdOI_.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在阿那亚发生什么似乎都不意外</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn66Ql1vQruG0Ya4HWiLvFyiXLJZ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuj0Ptt1Zp2uby3dCel373wuBpTK.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>沙滩上的候鸟300，海市蜃楼一般漂浮的狂欢沙城</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmunORSwMI__xJtzZFD54RMme-Iw.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>采访《繁华》舞台剧导演 马俊丰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMLkGwrTKU9wHAMJv2aO_KpXJp7.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>夜晚的沙城市集</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkqSaJdnI2m5xO8_lcr_EamxJKsN.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>路过《命令哈姆雷特》的大哥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtuvLzecM_FraYSuY5PV7nSSUVZq.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>陈明昊与他的戏剧《海边的伽利略》凌晨四点半</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fis-3i8BT6MLl9sWXG1WLsd-20pP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>用阿那亚的沙子烧一块玻璃带回家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhfY4eSEkRdVaw0UyKLrBIIlofuU.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>孤独图书馆上的天守物语</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJ7TbIoXQPzIou-BrI7m--LAL3V.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《4.48精神崩溃》与海浪的完美结合</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVFjazsq8XyKQ4fiTX4e3JUg1Rw.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3jwT6Y0b6bKyg87PG59TsSm_Aa.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《白鲸》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FioiujrkmYUQHVFFAkIJxtxeL2r6.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《你的身体爱的宇宙》结束后与全场女性观众齐舞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtxWbVqsCy4bKR9BR6MG0dm-ZCtN.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>巡游之后的篝火</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnoJWVex89SGDDYeFa6VMljbyb7j.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>梁龙的头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSOlZKvaUVjiR7XCj9xowUsRFZE.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>环境戏剧《等待戈多》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhFmf5mgvy5VPo3qWezh1tO4cQjc.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
