    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春节假期过完了，节目上线这天是元宵节，祝各位听友家人们元宵节快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>春节档的几部影片大家都看了吗，春节看电影似乎已经成为了一种新时代的春节习俗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播三哥和老白大年初一就扎进影院，紧跟热度看了三部春节档的爆火影片；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> 正片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 《热辣滚烫》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 剧情简介 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 三哥和贾玲深度共鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 贾玲硬拉120kg什么概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 拿减肥当卖点宣传是消费观众吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 老白谈原版《百元之恋》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 张小斐演技吓人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 《二十条》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2935">48:55</a> 一定要通过女性被侵害来表达么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 《飞驰人生2》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3544">59:04</a> 又说到《热辣滚烫》了，三哥真是爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3688">61:28</a> 《红毯先生》还是得看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3750">62:30</a> Outro</span></p>]]></description>
