    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>减肥，一个更古不变困扰我们的话题，2023年减肥运动小有成就的二位主播，决定将自己的一些经验教训分享给大家，希望大家能吃好喝好练好，减肥快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 三哥为什么要减肥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 老白为什么要减肥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> 减肥弯路之一：不科学的自律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> 减肥弯路之二：不谈剂量=耍流氓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a> 生酮饮食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2096">34:56</a> 粗粮可以随便吃吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2353">39:13</a> 局部减肥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 纯靠饿能瘦不？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2672">44:32</a> 大体重减脂有没有副作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3001">50:01</a> 代餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 减肥药（司美格鲁肽，利拉鲁肽）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3342">55:42</a> 有氧减脂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3671">61:11</a> 力量训练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4335">72:15</a> 健身房怎么选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4626">77:06</a> 蛋白粉，天使还是魔鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4666">77:46</a> 三哥增肌期一天要吃的鸡胸肉😓：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtNEshAhQ5HQX4cEKqxp3JQLRCBs.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
